      "alt": "An antique zinc trunk open on a workshop floor surrounded by vintage hand woodworking tools",
      "caption": "The zinc seaman's trunk that Promode Sen carried across four hundred miles from Burma in 1948.",
      "imageSize": "landscape",
      "imageWidth": 1200,
      "imageHeight": 800
